1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,660
Wow! You look nice. What's the occasion?
穿這麼帥要去哪裡？

2
00:00:06,870 --> 00:00:09,560
Monica and I are celebrating our 10-month anniversary.
摩妮卡和我要慶祝滿十個月 

3
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,500
Got reservations at Jean-George.
我們在喬治法國餐廳訂了位置

4
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,060
How'd you get in?
你們怎麼進得去？

5
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,330
Made a few calls, pulled some strings...
打了幾通電話，動用一些關係

6
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,600
...and they'll seat us if we both have chicken and don't get dessert.
如果我們都吃雞，不叫甜點 就讓我們11：30進去吃

7
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,680
-Hi,Chandler. -Hey,Caitlin.
錢德 凱特琳

8
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,080
Somebody got a haircut.
新髮型喔

9
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:28,690
I hate it. I look like an 8-year-old boy.
我恨死了，活像八歲小男孩

10
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:32,590
If that was true, gym class would've been more interesting.
如果真的是這樣 那以前上體育課會有趣許多

11
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,730
-It's $27 even. -Okay. Here you go.
正好27美元 好，給你

12
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:39,960
Where's the chicken?
你養的雞呢？

13
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,030
It's in the back. The duck pissed him off.
在後頭，被這鴨子氣跑了

14
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,200
He said that eggs came first.
鴨子說先有蛋，才有雞

15
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:48,030
-Thanks. I'll see you later. -Bye.
謝了，下回見 好，再見

16
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,710
What the hell was that?
你那樣算是什麼？ 

17
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:55,920
-What? -The flirting.
