18
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:59,640
Aren't you supposed to be going out with, let's see, my sister?
你不是正要去… 跟誰來著… 我妹妹約會？

20
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:01,610
I wasn't flirting.
我沒在打情罵俏啊

21
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:06,320
It was totally flirting! "Somebody got a haircut...."
那根本就是打情罵俏 「新髮型喔」

23
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:11,560
First of all, the impression? Uncanny.
好，第一件事 你模仿得很蹩腳

24
00:01:12,270 --> 00:01:16,260
Second, that wasn't flirting. That was just casual conversation.
第二，那不是打情罵俏 只是兩個人閒話家常而已

25
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:18,070
Yeah, right.
我聽你在說

26
00:01:18,270 --> 00:01:20,500
You wanna see flirting? I'll show you.
你要看打情罵俏？ 我示範給你看

27
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,010
I'm good.
