28
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:26,940
The One Where Ross Can't Flirt
本集播出：「調情遜手」

00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:28,940
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

29
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:13,660
I am so proud of Joey.
