Don't you think it should be called Order and Law?
可是你不覺得 叫「網法游龍」比較對嗎？

32
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:22,430
No,because they arrest the guy and then try him.
不對，得先有法律才能去網啊

33
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,330
Don't get me started on that.
我話匣子一開可就沒完了

34
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:29,340
-I was not flirting. -And on your anniversary. For shame!
我沒在打情罵俏 還在紀念日當天，丟臉！

36
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:31,130
What's going on?
怎麼了？

37
00:02:31,350 --> 00:02:33,540
He was hitting on the hot delivery girl.
錢德跟外送辣妹打情罵俏

38
00:02:33,950 --> 00:02:36,440
I was not. And oh, God!
我才沒有，拜託你也小聲點

39
00:02:37,490 --> 00:02:40,390
You were. If anyone should be hitting on her...
有就是有 而且就算有誰跟要她搭訕 

40
00:02:40,620 --> 00:02:42,450
...it's the guy who's single...
也應該是單身的男人

41
