Si. Big star.
對，他是大明星 

68
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:12,940
My big fat Joey star.
我的胖胖喬伊大明星

69
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:20,050
Yeah,I weighed,like, 27 pounds when I was born.
對，我出生是27磅，所以…

70
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:27,560
-Happy anniversary! -Happy anniversary,10 months.
紀念日快樂 十個月紀念日快樂

72
