That was some hot love you gave me.
那晚你給的愛還真是火熱

77
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,280
-I'll get ready. -Wear those earrings I got you.
我去準備一下 不如戴我送你的耳環？

78
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:47,140
That's a great idea. I was saving them for something special.
好主意，就是要留到特別場合 好

79
