-You've got to go home. -But I like it here.
你得回家去 但是我喜歡這裡啊

81
00:04:53,990 --> 00:04:57,120
Get the earrings you borrowed. He wants me to wear them.
你得回家拿我借你的耳環 錢德要我今晚戴那副耳環

82
00:04:57,330 --> 00:05:01,320
I think they're in my purse. Go get dressed and I'll look for them.
好，應該是放在我皮包裡 你去穿衣服，我去找 好

84
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,960
I need those earrings you borrowed.
瑞秋，我要拿回我借你的耳環

86
00:05:11,210 --> 00:05:13,000
Yeah,I'll be right back.
好，我馬上回來

87
00:05:23,690 --> 00:05:25,180
Phoebe,you speak ltalian?
菲比，你會說意大利文？

88
00:05:25,490 --> 00:05:26,650
I guess so.
我猜是吧

89
00:05:30,730 --> 00:05:33,220
-Here you go. -Thanks. Where's the other one?
來，謝謝你 等等 另外一個呢？

91
