Oh,what, you want both of them? That's a little greedy, don't you think?
你兩個都要？ 會不會太貪心了？

93
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:41,430
Rachel Karen Greene, where's the other one?
瑞秋葛林，另一個耳環呢？

94
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:44,630
Look, just don't freak out, but I kind of lost it.
好啦，你先別生氣 好像不見了 

95
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:48,330
I know it's in the apartment, but I definitely lost it.
還在公寓裡，但一定不見了

96
00:05:48,910 --> 00:05:51,900
What'll I tell Monica? She wants to wear them tonight.
那我要怎麼跟摩妮卡說？ 她今晚就要戴

97
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:55,480
-Tell her to wear her own earrings. -These are her earrings.
叫她戴自己的耳環 這就是她的耳環

98
00:05:55,621 --> 00:05:58,146
不會吧…

99
00:05:58,190 --> 00:06:01,990
You lent me her earrings? I'm not allowed to borrow her stuff!
你把摩妮卡的耳環借我？ 我不能借她的東西耶

100
00:06:03,490 --> 00:06:05,690
-Why not? -Because I lose her stuff!
為什麼？ 因為我都會弄丟

101
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:17,500
You see that blind guy? I'm gonna bash his head in later.
看到那個盲人沒？ 我等一下會痛打他一頓

103
00:06:20,010 --> 00:06:23,700
My big scene's coming up. The big scene coming up.
我的主戲就快來了 主戲就快來了

104
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:28,310
If you said, "Big lima bean bubbling up," would she know the difference?
若你說「吃葡萄不吐葡萄皮」 她會不會比較懂？

105
00:06:30,650 --> 00:06:31,950
What are you doing?
瑞秋，你在幹嘛？

106
00:06:32,490 --> 00:06:35,460
Oh, I just can't watch. It's too scary.
我不敢看，太恐怖了

107
00:06:36,690 --> 00:06:38,120
It's a diaper commercial.
現在是賣尿布的廣告

108
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:43,290
Yeah,well,you know me. Babies,responsibilities....
你也知道我的 小孩啊，責任，嚇死人

109
00:06:45,670 --> 00:06:49,120
-Pizza delivery. -I'll get it! I will get that!
比薩外送 我來開 我來拿

111
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:53,000
How does my hair look?
我的髮型如何？

112
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:56,600
Ross,it hasn't moved since 1996.
羅斯，你從96年就沒變過了

113
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:05,150
One vegetarian pizza. It's 12.50.
一個素食比薩 12.5美元

115
00:07:06,690 --> 00:07:09,160
By the way,if it makes you feel any better...
對了，如果這會讓你好過些 

116
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,480
...I happen to like 8-year-old boys.
我正好很喜歡八歲男孩

117
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:16,820
What?
什麼？

119
00:07:19,730 --> 00:07:21,700
Your hair. Before. Your hair.
你的頭髮 之前你說過

120
00:07:21,940 --> 00:07:26,000
You said you thought your hair looked like an 8-year-old boy's...
你的髮型很像八歲男孩

121
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,370
...and I'm just saying I like it.
我說我很喜歡…

122
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:30,070
The hair.
你的髮型

123
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:33,770
Thanks.
謝謝

124
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:39,880
You understand,I don't actually like 8-year-old boys.
我不是真的喜歡八歲男孩

125
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:44,050
All I'm looking for is the money.
我在等你找錢

126
