Here you go. Stop bringing us pizzas,you.
這裡 別再幫我們送比薩了

128
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:48,590
I'm gonna try.
我都快哭了

129
00:07:52,230 --> 00:07:53,360
You're welcome.
不客氣

130
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,870
You couldn't let me have her, could you?
你就是不想看我得手，對吧？

131
00:07:57,100 --> 00:08:01,040
This is a girl I really like, and you had to swoop in there!
什麼？我真的很喜歡這個女孩 你幹嘛要來湊熱鬧？

133
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,230
What?
