135
00:08:07,110 --> 00:08:08,270
Thank you for that.
真是多謝你了

136
00:08:10,490 --> 00:08:11,580
I was not flirting.
我沒有打情罵俏

137
00:08:11,790 --> 00:08:13,750
It's okay. I don't care. That's fine.
沒關係，我不在意，無所謂

138
00:08:14,090 --> 00:08:15,920
Really?
什麼？ 真的？

139
00:08:16,590 --> 00:08:19,420
It's no big deal. I do it all the time.
小事一件，我動不動也是

140
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:24,730
You flirt with guys all the time?
你動不動就跟人打情罵俏？

141
00:08:25,330 --> 00:08:29,500
It doesn't mean anything. Just like it doesn't mean anything with you.
是啊，那又不代表什麼 你不是也沒別的意思

142
00:08:29,770 --> 00:08:32,140
There's a difference. You're a lot hotter.
對，但是有一點很不一樣 你比我辣多了

143
00:08:32,340 --> 00:08:33,600
True story.
這是真的

144
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,740
This actually bothers you?
錢德，你真的介意？

145
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:39,470
Yes, and I think it'd bother a lot of people.
對，我是介意 我想很多人都會介意

146
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:41,340
When you and Ross dated...
瑞秋，你和羅斯在一起那時

147
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:44,640
...did it bother you when he flirted with other women?
他跟別的女人打情罵俏 你會不會介意？

148
00:08:44,850 --> 00:08:48,190
No,it bothered me when he slept with other women.
不會…他跟別的女人上床 我才會介意

149
00:08:51,990 --> 00:08:53,820
And thank you for that.
真是多謝了

150
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,830
I never had to worry.
但其實我沒啥好擔心的 

151
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:59,290
He was never good at the flirting thing.
羅斯從來就不太會打情罵俏

152
00:08:59,438 --> 00:09:02,305
What?
什麼？…

153
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:05,300
What are you talking about? It worked with you.
你在說什麼？對你不就有效

154
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:06,670
No, you're right.
你說的真是對極了

155
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:11,470
We met,you flirted and then bam! Nine years later, you had me.
我們認識，你對我打情罵俏 九年後你終於追到我了

156
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,870
All right.
好…

157
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:17,180
You know what I'll do? I'll order another pizza.
就這麼辦 我再來點個比薩 

158
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,510
And when Caitlin gets here...
等凱特琳來的時候

159
00:09:19,820 --> 00:09:22,620
...I will show you how well I flirt.
我就來讓你們見識一下 我有多會打情罵俏

160
00:09:22,860 --> 00:09:24,850
I will get her phone number.
我還能要到她的電話號碼

161
00:09:25,130 --> 00:09:27,620
And not the one on the menu.
不是比薩店的電話啦

162
00:09:30,630 --> 00:09:33,030
-I found it. -Thank God! Where was it?
我找到了 謝天謝地，在哪裡找到的？

164
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,190
On your dresser.
在你的梳妝台上

165
00:09:34,470 --> 00:09:37,630
Okay, that is the one we already have.
那是原來的那一個

166
00:09:38,210 --> 00:09:40,500
Here's my big scene. My big scene's here.
我的主戲到了，就是現在

167
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:44,140
-Wanna bet nobody heard anything? -No bet.

168
00:09:45,380 --> 00:09:46,570
Anybody home?
有人在嗎？

169
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,910
-Oh,my God. -What?
天啊 幹嘛？

170
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:53,520
Everybody keep smiling. It'll kill my grandmother if she finds out.
大家繼續笑 我祖母發現一定會難過到死掉

173
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:54,640
What is it?
怎麼了？

174
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:56,690
They cut me out of the show.
我那一段被剪掉了

175
00:09:57,730 --> 00:09:58,890
What?
什麼？

